{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move toward it. If object approachable, take it. Finally, process object properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
